{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50324","headline":"久憾缧绁之作 · 佚名","name":"久憾缧绁之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一从命驾赴戎乡，几度躬先亘法梁。\n吐纳共钦澎湃注，纵（原作「踪」）横竞揖慧风扬。\n今时有恨同兰艾，即日无辜比冶长。\n黠虏莫能分玉石，终朝谁念泪沾裳。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}